      <h1 id="dns-operator-openshift-io-v1" class="group scroll-mt-20">DNS [operator.openshift.io/v1]<a href="#dns-operator-openshift-io-v1" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h1>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold">Description</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground">
      <p>DNS manages the CoreDNS component to provide a name resolution service for pods and services in the cluster.</p>
      <p>This supports the DNS-based service discovery specification: https://github.com/kubernetes/dns/blob/master/docs/specification.md</p>
      <p>More details: https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/administer-cluster/coredns</p>
      <p>Compatibility level 1: Stable within a major release for a minimum of 12 months or 3 minor releases (whichever is longer).</p>
      </dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Type</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><CodeBlock code={"`object`"} lang="plaintext" /></dd>
      </dl>
