      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold">Description</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground">
      <p>Upstream can either be of type SystemResolvConf, or of type Network.</p>
      <ul>
      <li>For an Upstream of type SystemResolvConf, no further fields are necessary: The upstream will be configured to use /etc/resolv.conf.</li>
      <li>For an Upstream of type Network, a NetworkResolver field needs to be defined with an IP address or IP:port if the upstream listens on a port other than 53.</li>
      </ul>
      </dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Type</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><CodeBlock code={"`object`"} lang="plaintext" /></dd>
