      <TableCell>clusterDomain is the local cluster DNS domain suffix for DNS services. This will be a subdomain as defined in RFC 1034, section 3.5: https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc1034#section-3.5 Example: "cluster.local" More info: https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/services-networking/dns-pod-service</TableCell>
